---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-gray-800 bg-gray-900 text-gray-400">
	<div class="border-b border-gray-800">
		<div class="container mx-auto flex flex-col items-start gap-5 px-6 py-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-center md:px-12">
			<div class="flex-1">
				<p class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold text-white/80">Already have your call booked?</p>
				<p class="max-w-xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
					Complete the pre-call intake form so Brad can review your goals, brand, and context before you meet. It
					takes about 15–20 minutes and means your call is focused on strategy, not introductions.
				</p>
			</div>
			<a
				href="/brandrise/intake"
				class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-sm border border-white/15 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap text-white/70 transition-all hover:border-accent/50 hover:text-accent"
			>
				Complete the Intake Form
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="container mx-auto flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-8 md:flex-row md:px-12">
		<img src="/images/ascend-logo-white.webp" alt="Ascend Consulting" class="h-8 opacity-80" loading="lazy" />
		<p class="text-sm">&copy; {year} Ascend Consulting. All rights reserved.</p>
	</div>
</footer>
